      "text": "# A development team: a lead with implementers, a reviewer, a researcher and a monitor it starts on demand.\ndefault: claude\nincludes: catalog:shared/includes\n\nplugins:\n  seat:\n    actions:\n      route: brg-seat route <vendor> <model>\n\nroles:\n  lead:\n    plugins: {seat: [route]}\n    prompt: orchestrator.md\n    interactive: true\n    vendor: claude      # inbox-only lead; Claude uses a background msg wait\n    start: true\n  implementer:\n    prompt: implementer.md\n    vendor: codex\n    parent: lead\n    start: false\n    max: 4\n    worktree: true\n  reviewer:\n    prompt: reviewer.md\n    vendor: claude\n    parent: lead\n    start: false\n  researcher:\n    prompt: researcher.md\n    vendor: codex\n    parent: lead\n    start: false\n    args: [--search]    # Codex's web search\n  monitor:\n    prompt: monitor.md\n    vendor: claude\n    parent: lead\n    start: false\n"
